+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. No architecture decision record, policy document, or other written statement in this repository specifies whether versions follow semantic versioning, calendar versioning, or any other scheme; the only versioning-related artifacts present (the `Version` constant in `version.go` and the release headings in `CHANGELOG.md`) reflect current practice rather than a documented policy, so no scheme should be assumed until one is explicitly recorded.
